  "body_text": "You don't often get email from support@glassworkshounsell.co.uk. Learn why this is important\n\nHi Giles,\n\nThank you for taking the time to speak with me today.\n\nAs discussed, I'm contacting you on behalf of Glassworks Hounsell (GWH).\n\nOne area we are particularly interested in developing is the manufacture and supply of substantial, bespoke actuator assemblies for machinery manufacturers and OEMs.\n\nGWH already has experience in this area, including supplying actuators into specialist machinery applications over a number of years.\n\nOur manufacturing capability includes:\n\nCNC turning and large-format CNC milling\n\nPrecision machining of substantial components\n\nMIG, TIG and ARC welding\n\nFabrication and assembly\n\nCAD/CAM capability\n\nIn-house inspection and CMM measurement\n\nExperience across steels, stainless steels, bronze, aluminium and specialist alloys\n\nWe are particularly interested in actuator requirements where quality, reliability and repeatability are important, rather than small commodity components.\n\nAs mentioned on the phone, we would welcome the opportunity to understand the actuators or hydraulic cylinders you currently source and whether GWH could potentially support you as an alternative or second UK manufacturing source.\n\nWhat would need to happen for GWH to be considered as a potential supplier?\n\nKind Regards,\n\nDaniel\n\nE: support@glassworkshounsell.co.uk\n\nP: 01384 437 366\n\nW: glassworkshounsell.co.uk\n\nPark Lane, Halesowen, West Midlands, B63 2QS\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive these emails you may unsubscribe",
